## Quality Standards
1. Balanced Progress
   - Test coverage appropriate but not excessive
   - Features functional but not over-engineered
   - Performance solid but not over-optimized
   - Documentation clear but not verbose
   - Changes minimal but complete

2. Implementation Quality
   - Code works as intended
   - Tests pass appropriately
